{"id":"n66316-3-27","stage":2,"title":"나타내다 · 显示","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66316-3-27-1","ko":"이번 설문 조사 결과 봤어?","zh":"你看过这次问卷调查的结果吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"설문","meaning":"提问，问卷","explanation":"설문：提问，问卷","readings":[{"term":"설문","audio":"/audio/3acbe7fce46351d02dc9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45003","senseId":"1","lemma":"설문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"조사","meaning":"调查","explanation":"조사：调查","readings":[{"term":"조사","audio":"/audio/e9e7abfc765737f0ebf8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62052","senseId":"1","lemma":"조사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결과","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"达成，有","explanation":"보다：达成，有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"18","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"3acbe7fce46351d0","term":"설문","zh":"提问，问卷","audio":"/audio/3acbe7fce46351d02dc9.mp3","entryId":"45003","definition":"为调查某事实而向多个人问问题；或指该问题。","pronunciation":["설문"]},{"id":"e9e7abfc765737f0","term":"조사","zh":"调查","audio":"/audio/e9e7abfc765737f0ebf8.mp3","entryId":"62052","definition":"为了解某事或某事物的内容，仔细地查看或查找。","pronunciation":["조사"]},{"id":"109383e344db8ae5","term":"결과","zh":"结果，结局","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3","entryId":"60093","definition":"某件事情或过程结束后的状态或现象。","pronunciation":["결과"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"达成，有","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"得到某种结果。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b3a515f871b63767556e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66316-3-27-2","ko":"응. 예상과는 전혀 다른 결과를 나타냈더라.","zh":"嗯，结果和预期完全不一样呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예상과는","meaning":"预想","explanation":"예상：预想；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"예상","audio":"/audio/d558732dc8ee759f5ce5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70522","senseId":"1","lemma":"예상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전혀","meaning":"全然","explanation":"전혀：全然","readings":[{"term":"전혀","audio":"/audio/34ef0e2fe1bc197f4478.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75769","senseId":"1","lemma":"전혀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다른","meaning":"不同，不一致","explanation":"다르다：不同，不一致；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다르다","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26824","senseId":"1","lemma":"다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결과를","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나타냈더라.","meaning":"显示，展现","explanation":"나타내다：显示，展现；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나타내다","audio":"/audio/36d31912afbbf3f2bd06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66316","senseId":"3","lemma":"나타내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"d558732dc8ee759f","term":"예상","zh":"预想","audio":"/audio/d558732dc8ee759f5ce5.mp3","entryId":"70522","definition":"预测将来的事情或状况；或指那样的内容。","pronunciation":["예ː상"]},{"id":"34ef0e2fe1bc197f","term":"전혀","zh":"全然","audio":"/audio/34ef0e2fe1bc197f4478.mp3","entryId":"75769","definition":"根本；或完全。","pronunciation":["전혀"]},{"id":"1db38b4e543bc73e","term":"다르다","zh":"不同，不一致","audio":"/audio/1db38b4e543bc73e4860.mp3","entryId":"26824","definition":"两个对象相互不一样。","pronunciation":["다르다"]},{"id":"109383e344db8ae5","term":"결과","zh":"结果，结局","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3","entryId":"60093","definition":"某件事情或过程结束后的状态或现象。","pronunciation":["결과"]},{"id":"36d31912afbbf3f2","term":"나타내다","zh":"显示，展现","audio":"/audio/36d31912afbbf3f2bd06.mp3","entryId":"66316","definition":"要发生某事的征兆或某事的结果显露于外。","pronunciation":["나타내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5c74ad09eeb7277fce6e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.72,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66316","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":89,"sequenceScore":2.4453,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，结果和预期完全不一样呢。","你怎么总在运动？","你看过这次问卷调查的结果吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，结果和预期完全不一样呢。","你看过这次问卷调查的结果吗？","你怎么总在运动？"],"answer":0}]}
